# The Chromaprint source release that fpcalc is built from (ADR-096).
# Read by Scripts/build-fpcalc.sh. Chromaprint's LICENSE.md says that as a
# whole it is under "the LGPL 2.1 license"; it is built against the project's
# LGPL FFmpeg, with Apple's vDSP for the FFT, so it brings no other licence in.
#
# To bump: change all three values, run `make bundle-fpcalc`, then compare a
# fingerprint of one track before and after. The SHA-256 is of the tarball at
# CHROMAPRINT_URL; confirm it against a second source before you commit it.
